+# mara-world seed — candidate list (civic.47 M1 item 7)
+
+Source: the manual-era `mara` Supermemory container, 148 documents, read 2026-11-03. Nothing has been written to `mara-world`; the builder chooses from this list. Rejected entries are listed by id and reason only.
+
+**Not candidates (132):** P-feedback and personal logs, builder/owner notes and relationship notes, container and protocol notes, edition audits and grading (newsroom work, not her desk), A's and citizen canon profiles (the ledger and canon search carry these), deleted or superseded canon (Port modernization, 2041 time anchor, mayor pronoun reversals), project-status/closure notes.
+
+**Clean, in-world, still true — proposed to copy as written (3):**
+- `rt8eqQbh` Vote records C78–C86 (Stabilization Fund 6-3, Health Center 6-2, OARI 5-4, Baylight 6-3, Transit Hub 7-1, with every seat).
+- `XUh7WPed` Baylight legal instruments (BD-83-REB bond, BD-83-TIF financing, oversight bodies).
+- `ocs1t4BD` Justice and public-safety roster — one clause dropped ("who respond to cycles but cannot initiate events" is apparatus).
+
+**Rejected among the 16 candidates (13):**
+- `wRzRRBz2` C101, `GP6Grp76` C100, `vNy3V9Gq` C99, `1TomnZB3` C98, `m4ZcD9fq` C97, `SKHBwVgV` C96 directive journals — written about the work, not in the world: real-world dates, "the user", file names, the engine and its review, template/parsing notes, an injected-prompt note (C101). Their civic substance is also the crisis/escalation frame the builder removed (e.g. C101: "sentiment CRATERED", "STUCK", "[ESCALATION]", "MARQUEE" pressure on D7). Copying would need this seat to rewrite them — authoring her memory.
+- `7cX8WouV` C95 carry-forward — edition planning (front section, sports debt).
+- `pHyVzjHC` C89 plan — names "civic voice agents", the newsroom and editions.
+- `B4L5L7ct` C87 status, `5dFw1C4n` C85 status board — stale; carry the deleted Port initiative and "versions" of an edition.
+- `tACYtML2` election calendar — "citizen ledger", tiers; dated C87.
+- `oH31Czad` executive roster, `1WXbP1cx` council composition — stale health and seat status (C87); the office map and brief carry current facts.
+
+**Exact text to write:** `output/mara-directives/mara-world-seed.json` (full text, edits listed); `node scripts/maraWorldSeed.js` screens it, `--write` copies, reads back and writes a receipt — only on the builder's go.
+
+**Recommendation:** copy the three clean entries; let `mara-world` grow from her own weekly run entries from C115 on. Her last three directives are read in full every week; the older AUTO files (C103 on) stay on disk.
